OL,3,GNEWSASchoolboy knife attacker texted
OL,4,A'sorry' to mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter learning about the unfolding
OL,7,Fevents on social media, his mother told
OL,8,Fthe jury at King's Lynn Crown Court she
OL,9,F"was in complete shock" when she
OL,10,Frealised her son was involved.
